Day 25 – HR Gender Diversity & Equality Project (Data Preparation)

Today I started my first unguided analytics project focused on building an HR Gender Diversity & Equality Dashboard.

The main focus of the day was data cleaning and transformation using Power Query in Excel to prepare the dataset for analysis.

Data Preparation Steps
	•	Standardized Total Compensation values to USD for consistent salary analysis.
	•	Extracted Hire Month and Hire Year from the Hire Date column.
	•	Extracted Leave Month and Leave Year from the Leave Date column.
	•	Extracted Year of Birth from the Date of Birth column.

Objective

These transformations prepare the dataset for time-series analysis, workforce demographic analysis, and salary comparisons across gender and departments.

This step highlights the importance of data preparation in the analytics workflow, ensuring the dataset is clean, structured, and ready for building dashboards and generating insights.